ind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001113","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m048-0096","start":96,"end":99,"surface":"魯釐公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001114","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p049","text":"季友母陳女，故亡在陳，陳故佐送季友及子申。季友之將生也，父魯桓公使人卜之，曰：『男也，其名曰「友」，閒于兩社，爲公室輔。季友亡，則魯不昌。』及生，有文在掌曰『友』，遂以名之，號爲成季。其後爲季氏，慶父後爲孟氏也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"季友","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001244","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001249","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"陳女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001249","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"季友","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001244","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"子申","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001114","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"季友","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001244","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"魯桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000229","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"人卜之","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、地點氏稱、未定官稱或未解指代；不補姓名、成員與父系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"友","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001244","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"公室","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、地點氏稱、未定官稱或未解指代；不補姓名、成員與父系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"季友","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001244","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"友","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001244","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"成季","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001244","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"季氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、地點氏稱、未定官稱或未解指代；不補姓名、成員與父系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"慶父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001113","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m049-0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"孟氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、地點氏稱、未定官稱或未解指代；不補姓名、成員與父系。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p050","text":"釐公元年，以汶陽鄪封季友。季友爲相。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m050-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"釐公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001114","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m050-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"季友","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001244","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m050-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"季友","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001244","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p078","text":"定公立，趙簡子問史墨曰：『季氏亡乎？』史墨對曰：『不亡。季友有大功於魯，受鄪爲上卿，至于文子、武子，世增其業。魯文公卒，東門遂殺適立庶，魯君於是失國政。政在季氏，於今四君矣。民不知君，何以得國！是以爲君慎器與名，不可以假人。』","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_c